s reply in two parallel fields (the app adds the English-letter pronunciation itself):\n- "say_kn": what LeLa says aloud. Kannada script ONLY (no Latin letters, no digits), at most two short sentences.\n- "say_en": English shown on screen: a translation of say_kn, plus any explanation.\nDo NOT ask the next lesson question yourself; the app asks it after "advance".\n\nReply with JSON only:\n{"action": "advance|retry|explain", "say_kn": "...", "say_en": "...", "note": "<one-line assessment for the log>"}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{\n "lesson": "Numbers one to five",\n "current_step": {\n  "id": "five",\n  "lela_asked_kn": "ಒಂದು ಕೈಯಲ್ಲಿ ಎಷ್ಟು ಬೆರಳುಗಳಿವೆ?",\n  "lela_asked_en": "How many fingers are there on one hand?",\n  "goal": "The student says ಐದು (five), alone or in a sentence.",\n  "example_answer_kn": "ಐದು",\n  "hint_en": "There are five fingers on one hand. Say ಐದು (aidu), \'five\'."\n },\n "attempts_so_far": 0,\n "max_attempts": 3,\n "recent_conversation": [\n  "LeLa: ನಮಸ್ಕಾರ! ಇವತ್ತು ಎಣಿಕೆ ಕಲಿಯೋಣ. ಒಂದು ಎಂದು ಹೇಳಿ.",\n  "Student: ಒಂದು [kn]",\n  "LeLa: ತುಂಬಾ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು! ಈಗ ಎರಡು ಎಂದು ಹೇಳಿ.",\n  "Student: ಎರಡು [kn]",\n  "LeLa: ಸರಿಯಾಗಿದೆ! ಈಗ ಮೂರು ಎಂದು ಹೇಳಿ.",\n  "Student: ಮೂರು [kn]",\n  "LeLa: ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿದೆ! ಒಂದು, ಎರಡು, ಮೂರು. ಮುಂದಿನ ಸಂಖ್ಯೆ ಯಾವುದು?",\n  "Student: Four [en]",\n  "LeLa: ಕನ್ನಡದಲ್ಲಿ ಹೀಗೆ ಹೇಳಿ: ನಾಲ್ಕು",\n  "Student: ನಾಲ್ಕು [kn]",\n  "LeLa: ತುಂಬಾ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು! ಒಂದು ಕೈಯಲ್ಲಿ ಎಷ್ಟು ಬೆರಳುಗಳಿವೆ?",\n  "Student: Five [en]"\n ],\n "student_turn": {\n  "language": "English",\n  "text": "Five",\n  "similarity_to_expected": 0.0\n }\n}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', params: SamplingParams(n=1, best_of=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.3, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, use_beam_search=False, length_penalty=1.0, early_stopping=False, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], include_stop_str_in_output=False, ignore_eos=False, max_tokens=400, min_tokens=0, logprobs=None, prom