s reply in two parallel fields (the app adds the English-letter pronunciation itself):\n- "say_kn": what LeLa says aloud. Kannada script ONLY (no Latin letters, no digits), at most two short sentences.\n- "say_en": English shown on screen: a translation of say_kn, plus any explanation.\nDo NOT ask the next lesson question yourself; the app asks it after "advance".\n\nReply with JSON only:\n{"action": "advance|retry|explain", "say_kn": "...", "say_en": "...", "note": "<one-line assessment for the log>"}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>user<|end_header_id|>\n\n{\n "lesson": "Numbers one to five",\n "current_step": {\n  "id": "goodbye",\n  "lela_asked_kn": "ತುಂಬಾ ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿ ಮಾಡಿದ್ದೀರಿ! ಇವತ್ತಿನ ಪಾಠ ಮುಗಿಯಿತು. ಮತ್ತೆ ಸಿಗೋಣ.",\n  "lela_asked_en": "You did very well! Today\'s lesson is over. See you again.",\n  "goal": "The student thanks the teacher or says goodbye.",\n  "example_answer_kn": "ಧನ್ಯವಾದ",\n  "hint_en": "Say ಧನ್ಯವಾದಗಳು (dhanyavādagaḷu), meaning \'thank you\'."\n },\n "attempts_so_far": 0,\n "max_attempts": 2,\n "recent_conversation": [\n  "LeLa: ತುಂಬಾ ಒಳ್ಳೆಯದು! ಒಂದು ಕೈಯಲ್ಲಿ ಎಷ್ಟು ಬೆರಳುಗಳಿವೆ?",\n  "Student: Five [en]",\n  "LeLa: ಕನ್ನಡದಲ್ಲಿ ಹೀಗೆ ಹೇಳಿ: ಐದು",\n  "Student: ಐದು [kn]",\n  "LeLa: ಕ್ಷಮಿಸಿ, ದಯವಿಟ್ಟು ನನ್ನನ್ನು ಮತ್ತೆ ಕೇಳಿ. ಒಂದು ಕೈಯಲ್ಲಿ ಎಷ್ಟು ಬೆರಳುಗಳಿವೆ?",\n  "Student: ಐದು [kn]",\n  "LeLa: ಸರಿಯಾಗಿದೆ! ತುಂಬಾ ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿ ಮಾಡಿದ್ದೀರಿ! ಇವತ್ತಿನ ಪಾಠ ಮುಗಿಯಿತು. ಮತ್ತೆ ಸಿಗೋಣ.",\n  "Student: How do you say 8 in Canada? [en]",\n  "LeLa: ಕೆನಡಾದಲ್ಲಿ, ನ್ನು ಎಂಟೆಂದು ಉಚ್ಚರಿಸಲಾಗುತ್ತದೆ.",\n  "Student: 8 [en]",\n  "LeLa: ಎಂಟು",\n  "Student: ಎಂತೂ [kn]"\n ],\n "student_turn": {\n  "language": "Kannada",\n  "text": "ಎಂತೂ",\n  "similarity_to_expected": 0.14\n }\n}<|eot_id|><|start_header_id|>assistant<|end_header_id|>\n\n', params: SamplingParams(n=1, best_of=1, presence_penalty=0.0, frequency_penalty=0.0, repetition_penalty=1.0, temperature=0.3, top_p=1.0, top_k=-1, min_p=0.0, seed=None, use_beam_search=False, length_penalty=1.0, early_stopping=False, stop=[], stop_token_ids=[], include_stop_